            <div xml:id="m-d6ed9800-a7e7-4c92-a364-241c96e445a5">
              <lg xml:id="m-dd8db8e9-24d8-4363-8446-74d2a4258f31">
                <l xml:id="m-b786c731-f509-429f-859e-80d0f5e043e8" facs="#m-a7dd9357-b675-4d8c-bc15-27248570f13a" label="text-like">Common of Martyrs. P. T. Vespers. 1141-1143</l><l xml:id="m-19aecbb9-d160-4e9c-bfbc-521809ad8568" facs="#m-6aef462d-f5f2-4379-9ab1-3363a2d16d0e" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-b90f4c74-a664-4f61-9deb-29c1925fc066" facs="#m-dc848f69-c5c4-4d3b-9871-9ebf70d62004" label="lyrics-like">TCcépta sit in conspéctu tuo, Dó-]pro cujus solemnitá̂te defértur. Per</l><l xml:id="m-80b1366e-9c61-4da0-887c-e269cdc41c3b" facs="#m-fbe4d142-5bc3-4802-ab61-29e2eb115630" label="lyrics-like">I mine, nostra devótio: et ejus  Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-b04bfee4-869b-470b-a196-a4c866348b60" facs="#m-858744a3-2f16-4dad-b09c-5bcdedbf5d57" label="lyrics-like">nobis fiat supplicatióne salutáris,</l><l xml:id="m-4318958b-3b27-4d2b-b6a1-8336e0894f88" facs="#m-a637b10c-1460-4903-8f23-afdebd2b565b" label="ambiguous">comm.5</l><l xml:id="m-67b399bb-d61b-4d5c-9658-123202820b7b" facs="#m-a4f82f1a-a505-43d9-b971-bb3a243f8066" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-e78ff3c8-622e-43b3-92bf-10030e4b148a" facs="#m-6c9d061a-c565-48ba-95fa-90272a5c5cd4" label="lyrics-like">UI mí-hi mi-nístrat, “me sequá- tur:</l><l xml:id="m-c7497667-2595-488c-8b03-e03a1b27a9a7" facs="#m-20750c8a-66d1-40db-bd3e-482b4920c18b" label="ambiguous">et ubi</l><l xml:id="m-d5ff7562-1237-473a-903e-1da5cf6970f8" facs="#m-8384e279-f989-4ad1-9f65-c5ebf789a006" label="ambiguous">illic</l><l xml:id="m-115328f5-1fa9-4e8f-b1bd-eabd43b36481" facs="#m-22a6e98d-e99a-412c-b20d-182ae04d2054" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-adc38638-b83f-4772-8cd5-e943101ec195" facs="#m-4aa61ebf-255a-4a23-9db4-134544d6575f" label="lyrics-like">mini-ster mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-256ab563-a2c9-4d0b-abb9-a2ec8eada103" facs="#m-2861e1f2-a393-4a53-a7a1-d5811cc04b93" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-98a1758b-2ec4-471f-89d1-52bc2054f832" facs="#m-beee5da8-cc0e-4fa7-a88e-dcd954f98415" label="ambiguous">go sum,</l><l xml:id="m-2c4b9a09-6f09-466c-be9c-9a44ed0a0aba" facs="#m-c3f57945-3e22-4ae0-996b-5affef364fe0" label="lyrics-like">é-rit.</l><l xml:id="m-0bd3a9b8-37cb-4968-886f-009b3dd58949" facs="#m-77ec75f2-ddab-406a-8764-e5675ce5e3c8" label="ambiguous">us</l><l xml:id="m-23a55e4a-5a7d-4c56-abc7-c8cd27bce058" facs="#m-ada17bf7-745f-4b72-9d79-9239f1ff66eb" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-47c99fab-7035-48e3-b244-b84c74c10e84" facs="#m-60210e34-198a-4306-8c92-b6b5c5bdee74" label="lyrics-like">Efécti participatióne múneris ! tum, intercedénte beáto N. Már¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d88692f-1a67-4523-96af-cb9d007137f3" facs="#m-9d28a795-1c75-4b40-8f38-e41bc58d3427" label="lyrics-like">Lt sacri, quaésumus Dómine Deus tyre tuo, sentiámus efféctum. Per</l><l xml:id="m-f8b2b842-1e5e-4d0f-9101-b5da27aaef47" facs="#m-0dde42cd-882a-45b2-ad71-15ae8c8a4092" label="lyrics-like">noster: ut, cujus exséquimur cul-] Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-803f334f-9830-4572-b1cd-52742557b65b" facs="#m-30a039c8-ede3-4c72-af78-ace689ea40b9" label="ambiguous">~=L==== === ==R======R==*</l><l xml:id="m-11285ba0-f2f5-42b7-b169-ea19368b163e" facs="#m-5f5a74c9-343c-4ed2-9639-a9732a98c2c1" label="ambiguous">COMMON</l><l xml:id="m-8bd9bd32-4416-4fa7-b0e7-1d4721afe546" facs="#m-4f29a3a7-d368-4dc4-850b-e467ac47f46c" label="text-like">OF ONE MARTYR AND SEVERAL MARTYRS</l><l xml:id="m-9fb4de09-46ee-4d38-aba7-98a772482ba2" facs="#m-fb09ea6c-d1f8-416d-b6da-bc47673cd638" label="text-like">IN PASCHAL TIME.</l><l xml:id="m-f38c5c27-41c9-4172-915f-5a304ebffdc6" facs="#m-fd831aee-16ac-4001-9964-dc2d3670f488" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-9aedda4d-78ee-4577-b91c-861c9568b930" facs="#m-0cf510a3-6e78-48a6-9953-4729398f9285" label="text-like">All from the Common of Apostles in Paschal Time, p. I118, excent the</l><l xml:id="m-ff847064-ab72-4c36-8966-fe5a905c49d7" facs="#m-22fd95b6-6d10-42dd-a525-95ecb349ff88" label="ambiguous">Hymn. which will be found pp. 1126-1127.</l><l xml:id="m-0bfc0b68-9610-4b8f-be51-4d69a685b7db" facs="#m-459f990e-1c17-4b04-b8da-c04542ef5174" label="text-like">The Prayer is proper or from the Common out of Paschal time.</l><l xml:id="m-93d88808-d085-4397-8aca-a5e75be7bf00" facs="#m-f1cb3b64-39df-4951-b6f1-2d96817fbf15" label="text-like">Compline of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-eea7adea-347f-4541-9351-d290150d4950" facs="#m-441f1a1c-27d7-4ff7-acb1-016d58dc0260" label="text-like">At the Little Hours, all is from the Common of Apostles in Paschal time.</l><l xml:id="m-802c1a85-fa1a-48f0-b45e-ebe5a0b02ac8" facs="#m-54463318-979f-48e9-937f-bf945e211f49" label="text-like">The Masses are found at the end of second Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-7ea837b0-650c-4a2c-984a-3165cbb15faa" facs="#m-280595c5-5031-4e6c-b611-9ee446b00943" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-bb38d308-446e-4836-b3d7-f540cc344d39" facs="#m-54509b58-b6f5-4a00-9b8e-10c65952c91a" label="text-like">Psalms from the first Vespers of the Common of Apostles in Paschal time,</l><l xml:id="m-da11b9e8-5206-4915-96fd-b8893689a672" facs="#m-a7d2e2fd-993e-49ef-a104-11919d419d2b" label="lyrics-like">p. 1120, except the fifth Psalm, which is Crédidi 2. D. p. 162.</l><l xml:id="m-81fa62d3-26f7-4aea-ab65-f926e594ddd3" facs="#m-6b843f2d-ab6a-4bf7-939a-6c9da68e6b0d" label="text-like">Antiphons and Chapter from the Common of Apostles in Paschal time.</l><l xml:id="m-356c3467-ae43-4d2c-9053-e171cb302f26" facs="#m-c23074ba-368c-40d4-af1a-2b64d1b6ecfb" label="ambiguous">p. 1120.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
